   ├─ usage
   │  └─ rhx git.package.patch begin --package <name>[@<version>] [--edit-dir <dir>] [--mode plan|apply]
   ├─ flags
   │  ├─ --package    (required) the dependency to patch; add @<version> when several are installed
   │  ├─ --edit-dir   (optional) where to open it; default node_modules/.pnpm_patches/<name>@<version>; must sit inside the tree
   │  └─ --mode       (optional) plan (default) previews; apply opens the dir
